<Layout title="Terms — Rakhi Battle by BondBop" noindex>
  <article class="shell legal">
    <h1>Terms</h1>
    <p>Last updated: 26 August 2026.</p>
    <p>Rakhi Battle is a BondBop game operated in India by Divya Pandey. Support and grievance contact: <a href="mailto:support@bondbop.com">support@bondbop.com</a>.</p>
    <h2>Entertainment only</h2>
    <p>Rakhi Battle is a humorous entertainment product. Its profile is inspired by established sibling-research dimensions, but eight playful questions are not a validated psychological assessment, diagnosis or factual judgment of a family relationship.</p>
    <h2>No wagering or money game</h2>
    <p>Rakhi Battle involves no stake, wager, paid entry for a prize, cash or cash-convertible reward, deposit, withdrawal or monetary winnings. Free participation is not conditioned on buying an upgrade. Paid products are fixed-price digital-content unlocks for a completed sibling battle.</p>
    <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
    <p>Use nicknames and lawful, non-harmful content. Do not harass people, automate votes, probe private links, attack the service, or use it for wagering or cash competitions.</p>
    <h2>Age and purchases</h2>
    <p>If you are under 18, use the service with a parent or legal guardian's permission. Any paid purchase by or for a person under 18 must be made or authorised by a parent or legal guardian.</p>
    <h2>Purchases</h2>
    <p>Paid upgrades are one-time digital purchases linked to one battle and shared by both participants through that result link. Exact Answer Reveal is ₹49. The Digital Rakhi Gift Pack is ₹99, or ₹50 after Reveal. Taxes, if applicable, are shown at checkout. See <a href="/pricing">Pricing</a>, <a href="/shipping">Shipping</a>, <a href="/delivery">Digital Delivery</a> and <a href="/refund">Cancellation & Refunds</a>.</p>
    <h2>Availability</h2>
    <p>This is a time-limited festival experiment and may change or close. We do not guarantee uninterrupted availability, but we will not fabricate player counts, votes, leaderboards or testimonials.</p>
    <h2>Hall of Fame</h2>
    <p>Leaderboard participation is optional and requires an explicit choice from both players. Neither Yes nor No is preselected. Public entries show only the two nicknames, match score and a short unique battle code; answers remain private. We may remove abusive, misleading or inappropriate nicknames.</p>
    <h2>Grievance redressal</h2>
    <p>Grievance Officer: <strong>Divya Pandey</strong>. Email <a href="mailto:support@bondbop.com">support@bondbop.com</a> or use the <a href="/contact">support form</a>. We aim to acknowledge grievances within 48 hours and resolve them within one month, subject to the information needed to investigate the issue.</p>
  </article>
